ection and leader no-op already persisted and committed before the fresh proposal\",\n          \"No crash, snapshot, configuration change or transfer during measured schedule\"\n        ],\n        \"event_paths\": [\n          \"Propose -> appendEntry -> MsgStorageAppend/self MsgAppResp\",\n          \"MsgApp -> follower append -> durable append completion -> MsgAppResp -> leader MaybeUpdate -> maybeCommit\"\n        ],\n        \"activity_classes\": [\n          \"A1\",\n          \"A2\",\n          \"A6\"\n        ],\n        \"behavior_ids\": [\n          \"B_role_reset\",\n          \"B_propose_replicate\",\n          \"B_aggregate_commit\"\n        ],\n        \"fact_ids\": [\n          \"F_matched_support\"\n        ],\n        \"supporting_behavior_ids\": {\n          \"B_append_response_packaging\": \"Supplies the actual deferred local and remote acknowledgment history.\",\n          \"B_follower_accept\": \"Produces follower acknowledgments from actual append validation.\",\n          \"B_elect_transfer\": \"Establishes leader authority before the measured proposal.\",\n          \"B_ready_application\": \"Separates permitted quorum commitment from local application eligibility.\"\n        },\n        \"obligation_relation_kind\": \"consumption\",\n        \"counterevidence\": [\n          \"appendEntry already queues self acknowledgment behind storage completion, suggesting the one-follower prefix should remain uncommitted.\",\n          \"Quorum consumes voter Match and does not require the leader among the acknowledging majority.\"\n        ],\n        \"unknowns\": [\n          \"Construct a legal RawNode history with persisted election/no-op prefix, then hold leader append work while independently completing one and both followers.\",\n          \"Confirm independent observation of each voter's storage extent and leader commitment without inferring storage completion from Match.\"\n        ],\n        \"priority\": 0,\n        \"trigger_rationale\": 